window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After saving the court from their deadly curse, I'm now one of the most powerful fae in the realm.</p> <p>But not everyone is happy about my place by Taveon's side.</p> <p>While the Dark Fae plot to poison or stab me at every turn, a new threat rolls across the midnight lands. Forces gather from the darkness beyond. They have their sights set on the human realm, and we're the only ones who can stop them.</p> <p>But saving humanity means risking it all. If we win, I might never see my mates again.</p> <p><b><i>A Throne of Illusions</i></b> is the sixth and final full-length novel in a fantasy romance series. Set inside the Dark Fae realm, it's packed full of danger, magic, and romance that doesn't require choosing.</p>"; 
